theorem k215UnpairAt3568Step12 (a b n c: nat): $ k215PStep (k215UnpairAt3568State k215PNum3571 a b n c) = (k215UnpairAt3568State k215PNum3575 a b n c) $ = '(k215PAtCB k215PLookupUnpair3568_3571);

